## [v1.3.0] - 20.09.2022

### Changed

* Updated README; updated links to X-PSI code repository


## [v1.2.0] - 13.09.2021

### Added

* Updated README; added description of new files.

* Additional NICER products and model data files imported by the model modules.  
    - NICER_J0030_PaulRay_fixed_evt_25to299__preprocessed.txt
    - ni_xrcall_onaxis_v1.02_arf.txt
    - nicer_upd_d49_matrix.txt
    - crab_ratio_SA80_d49.txt
    - nicer_upd_energy_bounds.txt
    - interstellar_phot_frac.txt
    - nsx_H_v171019.out
    - README_v171019.txt


## [v1.1.0] - 09.03.2020

### Fixed

* The archive is now zipped (courtesy James Lattimer).

### Added

* Updated README; extended description of parameter extraction from files.
* Files containing only the weighted mass-radius sample files for each model,
    to ease handling.
* Mass-radius 68% and 95% highest-density credible region contour files for
    ST+PST to ease plotting (courtesy Geert Raaijmakers).
* Files containing the ST+PST hot region boundaries as point sequences on a
    unit sphere to ease plotting (suggestion by Georgios Vasilopoulos).
